"• 点击 Dock：按默认方式打开或回到 Harness\n• 点击菜单栏小鲸鱼：查看状态、切换打开方式、重启或停止服务\n• 红色圆点表示异常，橙色表示处理中，绿色表示运行正常\n• 应用内窗口关闭后，小鲸鱼和服务仍继续运行\n• “登录时静默启动”只启动小鲸鱼，不自动打开页面" = "• Click the Dock icon to open or return to Harness using your default method\n• Click the whale in the menu bar to check status, change the opening method, restart, or stop the service\n• Red means an error, orange means work is in progress, and green means the service is healthy\n• Closing the in-app window keeps the whale and service running\n• Launch Silently at Login starts only the whale and does not open a page";
